ple-how-item-title\">Show off your HNDRD gear</p>\n                <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-desc\">\n                  Share your HNDRD gear in a post or Instagram Story and tag @hndrd.us\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"hndrd-apple-how-points\">+5</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- CARD 3 -->\n        <article class=\"hndrd-apple-how-card\">\n          <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-top\">\n            <span class=\"hndrd-apple-how-step\">03</span>\n\n            <span class=\"hndrd-apple-how-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"20\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"20\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M2 3h3l3 13h12l2-9H6\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"hndrd-apple-how-card-title\">SHOP HNDRD PRODUCTS</h3>\n          <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-card-subtitle\">PURCHASE BONUS ENTRIES</p>\n\n          <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-card-desc\">\n            Purchase qualifying HNDRD rackets, shoes, strings, and accessories\n            through authorized HNDRD USA retailers to earn additional entries.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-list\">\n            <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item\">\n              <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-text\">\n                <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-title\">\n                  Purchase any HNDRD rackets and HNDRD shoes\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-desc\">Qualifying purchase through authorized retailers</p>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"hndrd-apple-how-points\">+20</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item\">\n              <div class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-text\">\n                <p class=\"hndrd-apple-how-item-title\">Purchase any HNDRD strings</p>\n          